qjAn4zBNUOr3AteHGqyVHYDcg-XzHBuJUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFFUc1A-mDoV-e1VLQ8jKy-d7yRQdn6C24qMadaTT0Q0g&oe=6A707FE4"}, {"file_name": "SampleScene_4K_17.05.2025_15-06-15.png", "id": "1733164250603383", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499361329_1733164253936716_5116391949939568888_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=izCqsa6njrUQ7kNvwEjB78v&_nc_oc=Adq6bM06CzUp4zlIZVIZq5WxzKtPuoOIdec7ZywZM1PxNcPZTU8Vw3H_RpJ0_to6_l8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHWVREVdoWn9u-cYwk2NRJAysbG6zI1irS7kXENL6ETEg&oe=6A70A09B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled571_20250630144933.png", "id": "719729697423252", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820594_719729700756585_5813998063970535049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2DLR0et_fhMQ7kNvwHFTPpK&_nc_oc=AdqaU9sKaxImV-ftTubtScT6AULBxALmrnZJ744QV6p8gJyKljeu-GTLA4ZR5lsE2XU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEwZ9m-8epMuG0hmtoPiqz8d-m8NiOIbcCh_EBEiwIkhw&oe=6A7077D1"}, "display_name": "Bouncing Baboon", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Bouncing Baboon is a explorable game where you can bounce and swing your way through the game, there are a variety of maps you can play through, such as:\n\nForest - Jump around on trampolines or climb up trees for a ton of fun\n\nCaves - Go down the slippery slide into the echoing cave where you will be tasked with mining resources (in a future update)\n\nShop - take a break from the chaos and put on some wear for your baboon\n\nBeach - Jump from platforms sitting on the water to jumping in the water and chill with friends\n\nShore - Ride in the giant ocean in this map with the brand new boats\n\nPool - Swim with friends in this smaller map or get a tan from the upstairs portion\n\nwhether you're a parkour master or a laid-back player, Bouncing Baboon is the game for everyone", "short_